<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area while the military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership. The United Nations Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027 but cut the troop ceiling to 12,000 and is planning a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers in the country. UN officials are also cutting the CAR peacekeeping force as the transition plan gathers pace. The conflict produced 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPY011Mk4yUkMyQ3NTR3RSMk5HTnlFMFVwaEpWV0ptSUNQTjlKa0J5UGo2N21hRGQ0b1k3Q1RCQXU4MXJ1UThVa3R5dFMwOWFDd19td2xvb3pBcnZkZUJmemZOdzMzSjhCQ1Y5MW1nT2xzazROTWY5Q2VJM09ZMXptNXRKT2xQQ3dkeldPb3BCZnVCVmhWNHlONkp1XzMyQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bleeding Cool News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOSFhLNGl2Ujc2RUNKaXNtMWZ1Ylo0RkVKVy15WERFMUMxQWxxUTZlVU1FMjN6YVNmRHBXeUh3Y0pHUUV4VjJ4RlhjRDNsTWZ6T2pTLTkycUVXTXZYdXNKRXUyQlQzLThZRDUyMjJzM3VzeW82WUZza2NrdTNNeEhKcnB1aFBCc0E4UXhYdGhNc3dqYmdyanNRZmNXdE9qYlVmM05iTXZhMV9Tb0NGZHVuR0IzbFNJQmkwZ243RTNvY3A5Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNbzRwa2hEOUZIcnkyQTRsbXBneWtocjVvaTZqcEkyRFRHVVpxQVlhVnk3SmFPWWdYT2Q0clRWMUNUdkpUUTFEN0hzQk9FMEhkRUhkbDc0UWw5MUdCZHI0ZExRQVAzQnBzdjAwcHRmeHZyaGxiZVVjLW1uQW1jQTZ4MERyRmtlY0JSdVAxVXB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bleeding Cool News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9mY2w1bk8tUm5ZUklGWlpxcGw1Mk9yUjRYVG9NajJfcTh0Vmd4QkJaU29nYjJsSzhZN2Q5VVo2S2JOby1YTEdMemFYWnQ1TFBXSGsxQlVtVGd3Q21aVlBtNW4xMGhlaHZKUEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo